{"A café-table game of matching ends and light hands.":"咖啡桌遊戲，匹配末端同輕手牌。","Continue Match":"繼續對局","Play":"開始遊戲","Daily Table":"每日桌面","done":"完成","Journey":"旅程","Practice":"練習","Challenges":"挑戰","Learn to Play":"學習遊戲","Hosted Play":"主持遊戲","Pass & Play":"輪流玩","Profile":"個人檔案","Settings":"設定","How to Play":"玩法說明","Connected to StarHermit · cloud saves on":"已連接到 StarHermit · 雲端儲存已開啟","Offline mode · progress stays on this device":"離線模式 · 進度會喺呢部裝置上面保持","← Back":"← 返回","Six short lessons. Each one asks you to make the move yourself.":"六堂短課。每個人都叫你自己做動作。","Total stars":"總星星數","Forty tables across the café circuit. Mastery tables every eighth stop.":"四十張枱喺咖啡廳圈入面。每八站就掌握一次表。","Replay":"重新開始","Start":"開始","{players}P · {ai} AI · first to {n}":"{players}P · {ai} AI · 先到 {n}","no draws":"冇抽中","1 draw/turn":"每回合抽 1 張","≤{n} rounds":"≤ {n} 彈","easy":"簡單","medium":"中等","hard":"困難","This table":"呢個表","Take a seat":"入座","Players":"玩家","Target":"目標","{n} pts":"{n} 分","Highest score":"最高分","Rounds max":"最多回合","Drawing":"繪圖","Draw until playable":"畫到可以玩為止","One draw per turn":"每回合一抽","Boneyard closed":"骨場關閉","Ranked":"排名","Yes":"是","No":"唔好","~Duration":"～持續時間","5–15 min":"5–15 分鐘","{n} players":"{n} 位玩家","{n} points":"{n} 分","Difficulty":"難度","Target score":"目標分數","Draw rule":"畫規則","Practice is unranked: undo and hints are on, ratings are untouched.":"練習係未排名嘅：復原同提示係開啟嘅，評分係未觸及嘅。","One shared seed for everyone today (UTC). Ranked: undo and hints are off.":"今日為大家分享一個種子（ UTC ）。排名：復原同提示已經閂咗。","You already played today — replaying is for fun and won't replace your result.":"你今日已經玩咗 — 重播係為咗玩，唔會取代你嘅結果。","Daily Table — {date}":"每日檯 — {date}","Today's shared table: first to {n}.":"今日共享表：先到 {n} 。","Today's shared table: first to {n}, boneyard closed.":"今日分享表：先到 {n} ，骨場關閉。","Today's shared table: first to {n}, one draw per turn.":"今日分享表：先到 {n} ，每回合一抽。","Time limit":"時間限制","Start challenge":"開始挑戰","Play with friends":"同朋友一齊玩","Create a private invitation or join public matchmaking. Hosted sessions are authoritative: the server validates every move.":"整個私人邀請或者加入公開配對。主持場次有最終決定權：伺服器會驗證每一步。","Hosted play needs the StarHermit shell. Offline, you can still pass-and-play or face the AI.":"主機遊戲需要星隱士外殼。離線，你仍然可以傳球或者面對 AI 。","Find public match":"搵公開配對","Pass-and-play (2 humans, this device)":"通過即玩（ 2 人，此裝置）","Searching for a match…":"正在搜尋對局…","Match found.":"搵到匹配。","Match found — hosted tables need the realtime play update; AI and pass-and-play tables are fully playable.":"搵到匹配 — 托管表需要實時播放更新； AI 同傳球枱都係完全可以玩嘅。","Matchmaking: {error}":"配對： {error}","Matchmaking unavailable: {error}":"配對唔可用： {error}","Pause menu":"暫停選單","Table":"桌面","Quit lesson":"戒課","Actions":"操作","Draw":"摸牌","Pass":"唔出","Hint":"提示","Undo":"復原","Skip anim":"略過動畫","Top view":"頂視圖","Your hand":"你嘅手牌","{name}’s hand":"{name} 嘅手","Lesson: {text}":"課程：{text}","First to {n}":"先到 {n}","First to best score":"第一至最佳分數","boneyard closed":"骨場閂咗","Draw until you can play":"抽到可以玩為止","No drawing":"冇畫圖","max {n} rounds":"最大 {n} 回合","Toggle table panel":"切換表面板","Open ends":"開放式兩端","No tiles on the table yet.":"枱面仲未有磚。","Round {n}":"第 {n} 局","target {n}":"目標 {n}","single match to best score":"單場比賽獲得最佳成績","Boneyard: {n} tile":"骨場：{n} 塊","Boneyard: {n} tiles":"骨場：{n} 塊","Your turn":"輪到你了","{name}’s turn":"{name} 嘅回合","Round over":"回合結束","{a} | {b} domino":"{a} | {b} 多米諾骨牌","{tile} on the table":"{tile} 喺張檯上面","{tile} double on the table":"{tile} 雙人喺枱面","Play selected tile on left end ({value})":"左端播放選定磚（ {value} ）","Play selected tile on right end ({value})":"右端播放選定磚（ {value} ）","open table":"開枱","playable":"可玩","not playable now":"而家玩唔到","Step {n} of {total}":"第 {n} 步，共 {total} 步","Achievement: {name} — {desc}":"成就：{name} — {desc}","It is not your turn.":"未輪到你。","That tile is not in your hand.":"嗰塊磚唔係你手上。","That tile does not match that end.":"嗰塊磚唔啱嗰端。","You have a playable tile — you must play it.":"你有個可以玩嘅磚 — 你一定要玩佢。","The boneyard is empty. You must pass.":"骨場係空嘅。你一定要通過。","Draw from the boneyard first.":"先喺骨場度畫。","Drawing is disabled at this table.":"喺呢個表度停用咗繪圖。","Only one draw per turn at this table.":"呢張枱每回合只可以抽一次。","You have reached the move limit.":"你已經達到移動上限。","The match is over.":"比賽結束。","The round is over.":"回合結束。","Follow the highlighted lesson step.":"跟住突顯咗嘅課程步驟。","That action is not recognized.":"嗰個行動唔會被認可。","Not allowed: {reason}":"唔允許：{reason}","Pass the device. {name} to play.":"傳送裝置。 {name} 去玩。","Your turn.":"輪到你。","Ends are {left} and {right}.":"末端係 {left} 同 {right} 。","No matching tile — draw from the boneyard.":"冇匹配嘅磚 — 喺骨園度抽。","No moves — you must pass.":"冇步可行——你必須跳過。","Round {n}. {name} opens.":"圓形 {n} 。 {name} 開啟。","Match won!":"比賽贏咗！","Match over. {name} wins.":"配對完。 {name} 贏咗。","Undone. Your turn.":"未完成。輪到你喇。","Try {tile} on the table.":"試下張枱上面嘅 {tile} 。","Try {tile} on the left end.":"試下咗端嘅 {tile} 。","Try {tile} on the right end.":"試下右端嘅 {tile} 。","Draw from the boneyard.":"喺骨場度畫。","Pass.":"通過。","Hint: {text}":"提示：{text}","First to {n}. Players: {names}.":"首先去 {n} 。玩家： {names} 。","First to the highest score. Players: {names}.":"第一到最高分。玩家： {names} 。","Paused.":"已暫停。","Resumed.":"已繼續。","Match restored.":"匹配恢復。","{name} to play.":"{name} 去玩。","tap":"輕點","select":"選擇","tile placed":"放置咗瓷磚","chain run":"鏈跑","draw from boneyard":"喺骨園度抽","pass":"通過","hint":"提示","undone":"復原","not allowed":"不允許","your turn":"輪到你喇","opponent’s turn":"輪到對手","round begins":"回合開始","round won":"回合贏咗","round lost":"回合失敗","table blocked":"表格被封鎖","match won":"比賽贏咗","match lost":"比賽輸咗","new record":"新紀錄","achievement":"成就","confirmed":"已確認","countdown":"倒數","time running out":"時間就快冇","paused":"已暫停","resumed":"已繼續","Player":"玩家","Display name":"顯示名稱","Save name":"儲存名稱","Record":"紀錄","Achievements":"成就","Leaderboards":"排行榜","This device":"此裝置","Global":"全球","Daily":"每日","cloud save synced":"雲端存檔已同步","saving…":"儲存中…","cloud sync unavailable":"雲端同步不可用","Signed in as {name} — {sync}. The name comes from your platform profile.":"以 {name} — {sync} 身份登入。呢個名嚟自你嘅平台個人檔案。","Guest profile — progress is stored on this device. Launch from the platform for cloud saves.":"訪客個人檔案 — 進度儲存喺呢部裝置上面。喺平台啟動嚟進行雲端儲存。","Matches":"比賽","Wins":"勝場","Win rate":"贏率","Current streak":"目前連勝","Best streak":"最佳連勝","Rounds played":"已玩局數","Dominos":"多米諾骨牌","Daily tables":"每日牌桌","Mastery stars":"精通星星","No scores yet — play a ranked table.":"仲未有分數 — 玩排名表。","Stored on this device only.":"只儲存喺呢部裝置上面。","No entries yet.":"暫時未有記錄。","This game has no platform leaderboard — personal bests live on this device and in your cloud save.":"呢隻遊戲冇平台排行榜 — 個人最佳成績會喺呢部裝置同埋你嘅雲端儲存入面直播。","Platform board unavailable — showing nothing yet.":"平台板唔可用 — 仲未顯示任何嘢。","Name saved.":"名稱已儲存。","Name saved: {name}":"已儲存名稱： {name}","Player {id}":"玩家 {id}","You":"你","Guide":"指南","Player 1":"玩家 1","Player 2":"玩家 2","daily":"每日","journey":"旅程","challenge":"挑戰","practice":"練習","tutorial":"教學","Audio":"音效","Graphics":"畫面","Table theme":"桌面主題","Ceramic Classic":"陶瓷經典","Midnight Espresso":"午夜濃縮咖啡","Sage Garden":"鼠尾草花園","Terracotta Sun":"兵馬俑太陽","Mono Ink":"單色墨水","Show numbers on tiles":"喺磚上面顯示數字","Accessibility":"無障礙","Left-handed layout":"左手佈局","Color-vision palette":"色覺配色","Default":"預設","Protanopia":"紅色盲","Deuteranopia":"綠色盲","Tritanopia":"藍黃色盲","Timing assistance (longer limits)":"計時輔助（限制更長）","Haptics (vibration)":"觸覺回饋（震動）","Hold to confirm":"按住確認","Replay tutorials":"重播教學","Gameplay":"遊戲玩法","Allow hints":"允許提示","Allow undo (practice/journey)":"允許撤銷（練習/旅程）","Keyboard & gamepad":"鍵盤與手掣","Gamepad: left stick / D-pad moves focus, A confirms, B cancels, Start pauses, X draws, Y hints.":"遊戲手柄：左搖桿/方向鍵移動焦點， A 確認， B 取消，開始暫停， X 畫， Y 提示。","Data & privacy":"資料同私隱","Erase local progress":"清除本地進度","Erase all local progress? This cannot be undone.":"抹去所有本地進步？呢個係復原唔到嘅。","Navigate left":"向左導航","Navigate right":"向右導航","Navigate up":"向上導覽","Navigate down":"向下導航","Confirm":"確認","Cancel":"取消","Pause":"暫停","Reset camera":"重設鏡頭","Play on left end":"玩咗端","Play on right end":"玩右端","The chain":"鏈","Tiles connect when touching ends show the same number. Each turn, play one tile on either open end. The open values are shown as large numbers beside the chain.":"當接觸到兩端時，瓷磚連接會顯示相同嘅數字。每個回合，喺任何一個開放端玩一個磚。開放值會喺鏈旁邊顯示為大數字。","Tap a tile to select it, then tap an end marker to place it. Tiles you can legally play stay bright; others dim. Double-tap a tile with only one legal end to play it instantly.":"㩒一下磚嚟揀佢，然後㩒一下端標記嚟放置佢。你可以合法玩嘅瓷磚保持明亮；其他人暗淡。撳兩下只有一個合法端嘅圖塊就可以即時玩。","Doubles":"雙打","Doubles sit crosswise on the chain. The open value stays the same on that side.":"雙打交叉坐喺鏈上面。嗰邊嘅開放值保持一樣。","Drawing & passing":"畫圖同傳球","No playable tile? Draw from the boneyard. If the boneyard is empty (or the table forbids drawing), pass. When every player passes in a row, the round is blocked.":"冇得玩嘅磚？喺骨場度畫。如果個骨場係空嘅（或者張檯禁止畫畫），就過嚟。當每個玩家連續傳球嗰陣，個回合就會被阻擋。","Scoring":"計分","Empty your hand to go \"domino\" and score every pip left in other hands. In a blocked round, the lowest remaining pip total wins the margin. First to the target score takes the match.":"清空你隻手去「多米諾」，然後喺其他手上攞到剩低嘅每一個點。喺一個被封鎖嘅回合入面，最低嘅剩餘點數總數會贏到邊際。首先去到目標分數先攞到比賽。","Controls":"控制","Select / confirm":"選擇/確認","Cancel / pause":"取消 / 暫停","Left end / right end":"左端/右端","Draw / pass":"抽 / 通過","Undo / hint":"復原/提示","Gamepad: D-pad or left stick moves focus, A confirms, B cancels, Start pauses, X draws, Y hints.":"遊戲手柄：方向鍵或左棍移動焦點， A 確認， B 取消，開始暫停， X 畫， Y 提示。","Paused":"已暫停","Resume":"繼續","Leave match":"離開比賽","Next round":"下一回合","Domino!":"多米諾！","Blocked round":"被封鎖嘅回合","points":"分數","(you)":"（你）","{name} held {n} pips":"{name} 持有 {n} 點","Match score":"對局分數","Play again":"再玩一次","Next stage":"下一關","Menu":"選單","Lesson complete!":"課程完成！","You win the table!":"你贏咗牌桌！","Dead even":"勢均力敵","{name} takes the table":"{name} 攞枱","Final score":"最終得分","pts":"分","{plays} plays, {draws} draws, {invalid} invalid":"{plays} 播放， {draws} 抽籤， {invalid} 無效","Target score reached":"已達目標分數","Round limit reached":"達到回合上限","Move limit reached":"已達步數上限","Time expired":"時間已過","{n} rounds":"{n} 輪","seed {seed}":"種子 {seed}","Next lesson":"下一課","Achievement unlocked: {name}":"解鎖成就：{name}","{title} — complete":"{title} — 完成","Lessons completed: {n}/6":"完成嘅課： {n}/6","First Domino":"第一個多米諾","Win your first match.":"贏得你嘅第一場比賽。","House Student":"屋企學生","Complete every tutorial lesson.":"完成每個教學課程。","Regular":"常規","Win 5 matches in a row.":"連續贏 5 場比賽。","Barista's Table":"咖啡師嘅檯","Beat a hard mastery stage (32 or later).":"擊敗一個困難嘅精通關卡（第 32 關或之後）。","Bottomless":"無底","Play 100 matches. Any mode, any pace.":"玩 100 場比賽。任何模式，任何步伐。","Seven Days of Coffee":"七日咖啡．","Finish 7 daily tables.":"每日完成7張表。","Café Champion":"咖啡館冠軍","Win all 40 journey stages.":"贏晒40個旅程階段。","Match the Ends":"配合兩端","Dominoes connect when touching ends show the same number. Play the tile that matches an open end.":"多米諾連接時，接觸兩端時會顯示相同嘅數字。玩同開放式端相符嘅圖塊。","The open ends are 2 (left) and 4 (right). Your 4|6 tile has a 4 — play it on the RIGHT end.":"開放端係2（左）同4（右）。你個 4 | 6磚有個4 — 喺右端玩。","The guide answers with its double 2|2 on the left end…":"指南用咗端嘅雙2 | 2嚟答 …","The ends are 2 and 6. Your 1|3 matches neither, and the boneyard is empty — so PASS.":"兩端係2同6。你嘅1 | 3都唔啱，而個骨場係空嘅 — 所以 PASS 。","That is the whole core rule: match an open end, or draw/pass when you cannot. Next: the boneyard.":"呢個就係成個核心規則：匹配開放式端，或者當你唔可以嘅時候平手 / 傳球。下一個：骨場。","The Boneyard":"骨園","No matching tile? Draw from the boneyard until you can play — or pass when it is empty.":"冇配對磚？喺骨場抽到你可以玩為止 — 或者喺佢空嘅時候過關。","Both ends show 6 and your 0|1 matches neither. DRAW from the boneyard.":"兩邊都係6，而你嘅0|1兩邊都唔啱。由骨場抽牌。","You drew 3|6 — it has a 6! Play it on either end.":"你抽咗3 | 6 — 佢有個6！喺任何一端玩。","The guide plays its double 3|3. The ends barely change…":"導遊玩佢嘅雙3 | 3。結局勉強唔會改變 …","Your 0|1 matches neither end. Draw again.":"你嘅0 | 1兩個都唔啱。再畫一次。","0|5 still cannot match. The boneyard is empty now, so PASS.":"0|5 仍然唔夾。牌堆已經空喇，所以 PASS。","Drawing keeps you in the round; passing is the last resort. Next: doubles.":"畫畫令你保持喺一個回合；通過係最後嘅手段。下一個：雙打。","Doubles Sit Crosswise":"雙人交叉坐","Doubles are placed across the chain. Both faces count as the open value.":"雙打係放喺鏈上面。兩個面都計為開放值。","Play your double 5|5 on the RIGHT end (a 5). See how it sits across the chain?":"喺右端打你嘅雙5 | 5（一個5）。睇下佢點樣坐喺條鏈對面？","The right end is still 5. The guide will answer with 1|5…":"右端仍然係5。導遊會用1 | 5嚟答⋯","Now the right end is 1. Finish the lesson: your 0|3 matches the LEFT end (3).":"而家右端係1。完成課堂：你嘅0 | 3同左端 (3) 相符。","Doubles keep the same end value — use them to hold a number your opponent cannot match.":"雙打保持相同嘅最終值 — 用佢哋嚟保留你對手匹配唔到嘅數字。","Going Domino":"去多米諾","Empty your hand and you win the round, scoring every pip left in opposing hands.":"清空你隻手，你就贏咗個回合，喺對手手上攞到剩低嘅每一個點。","Your last tile, 4|6, matches the RIGHT end. Play it to go DOMINO!":"你最後一個磚，4 | 6，同右端相符。玩到去多米諾！","You scored all 15 pips the guide was holding. Fewer pips in hand means less risk.":"你攞晒個導遊拎住嘅15個點數。手上嘅點數少啲就代表風險少啲。","Blocked Rounds":"被封鎖嘅回合","When nobody can play and the boneyard is empty, the lowest remaining pip total wins.":"當冇人可以玩，而個骨場又係空嘅時候，最低剩餘嘅點數總數贏。","Ends are 6 and 6. Your 0|1 (1 pip) cannot play, and the boneyard is empty. PASS.":"終點係6同6。你嘅0 | 1（1點）玩唔到，而個骨場係空嘅。通過。","The guide holds 2|5 (7 pips) and also cannot play — the round is BLOCKED.":"指南持有2 | 5（7點），亦都玩唔到 — 呢個回合被封鎖。","Your 1 pip beats the guide's 7. Shed heavy tiles early — they are a liability when rounds lock up.":"你嘅1點勝過導遊嘅7點。提早掉重嘅磚 — 當回合鎖定嗰陣，佢哋係一個責任。","Reading the Table":"睇緊個表","Keep a balanced hand: holding tiles that match both ends keeps you flexible.":"保持平衡嘅手：拎住兩端相符嘅磚可以保持你嘅靈活性。","Three of your tiles can play. The 2|4 keeps your hand balanced across both ends — play it on the RIGHT.":"你三塊磚可以玩。 | 4可以令你隻手喺兩端保持平衡 — 喺右邊玩。","The guide plays 2|6. Now the ends are 1 and 6…":"導遊玩2 | 6。而家兩端係1同6⋯","And you still hold the answer: play 1|6 — it matches BOTH open ends.":"你仲係握有答案：出1|6——佢同時配合兩個開放端。","You finished all six lessons. The café tables are open — good luck!":"你讀晒六堂課。咖啡廳嘅枱都開咗 — 祝你好運！","First Table":"第一張桌","A quiet corner table. Beat Marta to 30 points.":"一張安靜嘅角落檯。喺Marta之前攞到30分。","Open Ends":"開放式","Deep Boneyard":"深層骸骨場","Crosswise":"交叉方向","Light Hand":"輕手","Steady Pour":"穩陣倒","Narrow Window":"窄窗","Mastery: The Regular":"掌握：常規","Prove the basics against a sharper opponent.":"證明基本知識對抗更犀利嘅對手。","Third Chair":"第三個主席","Busy Lunch":"忙碌午餐","Short Supply":"短缺供應","Closing Time":"結束時間","Heavy Lids":"重蓋","Corner Booth":"角落卡位","Full House":"全滿","Mastery: Café Circuit":"精通：咖啡館電路","Espresso Shot":"咖啡射擊","Short and sharp — every round counts.":"短而鋒利 — 每一輪都好重要。","Reserved Sign":"保留標誌","Last Carafe":"最後一杯水壺","Silent Counter":"無聲計數器","Twin Grinders":"雙磨床","No Refills":"冇補充","Slow Sunday":"慢星期日","Mastery: House Blend":"掌握：屋企混合","Checkerboard":"棋盤格","Rush Hour":"繁忙時段","Quiet Regulars":"靜嘅常客","Steam & Static":"蒸汽同靜態","Tight Margins":"緊張嘅邊際","Long Afternoon":"漫長下午","Four Cups Empty":"四杯空","Mastery: Barista's Table":"精通：咖啡師嘅餐桌","Ink & Porcelain":"墨水同瓷器","Terrace Season":"露台季節","Last Train":"尾班車","Full Roast":"全烤","House Reserve":"房屋儲備","Closing Shift":"收班時段","The Long Game":"長局","Mastery: Café Champion":"精通：咖啡廳冠軍","The toughest table in the house. Take the title.":"屋企最硬嘅枱。攞個標題。","Speed Roast":"速烤","Reach 60 points in under 4 minutes.":"4 分鐘內達到 60 分。","Frugal Fingers":"慳手指","Win a 60-point match playing at most 22 tiles.":"贏一場60分嘅比賽，最多打22格。","Dry Counter":"乾式計數器","Win to 50 with the boneyard closed.":"贏到50同骨場閂咗。","Outnumbered":"數量超過","Beat three hard opponents racing to 90.":"擊敗三個困難對手，佢哋鬥快搶 90 分。","One Sip":"一啖","Win to 40 drawing at most one tile per turn.":"贏到40張，每回合最多抽一個磚。","Bottomless Cup":"無底杯","Outlast two hard opponents to 150.":"最後兩個硬對手去到150。","Blitz Table":"閃電枱","Four players, 4 rounds max — highest score takes it.":"四個人，最多四輪 — 最高分就攞到。","Minimalist":"極簡主義","Reach 50 in 5 rounds or fewer.":"5回合或以下達到50。","{n} of 3 stars":"{n}／3 粒星",", {n} of 3 stars":"，{n}/3 星",", locked":"，未解鎖","Close":"關閉","Open Options":"開啟選項","Change keys and buttons":"更改按鍵同按鈕","No usage statistics are collected.":"冇收集任何使用統計資料。","The table is empty — any tile opens the chain.":"張表係空嘅 — 任何磚都會打開鏈。","Music, effects and voice volumes and mute are set in the StarHermit Options (F1).":"音樂、音效同語音音量同靜音都喺 StarHermit 選項（F1）度設定。","Graphics quality, render scale and the frame rate are set in the StarHermit Options (F1).":"畫質、渲染比例同幀率都喺 StarHermit 選項（F1）度設定。","Reduced motion, high contrast and text size are set in the StarHermit Options (F1).":"減少動態、高對比度同文字大小都喺 StarHermit 選項（F1）度設定。"}
